IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `wra-core`
IMPORT `wra3-sch13`

-- Tests for wra3-sch13.l4 (Schedule 13, the three definitions of Part 2). Expected values are written from the text (raw lines
-- 3534, 3631, 3633, 3635), decided before running. The days below are INVENTED.

§ `sch 13 CPA 8(1) and 18(1) the Commission`

#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 8(1) the body is the Commission` `sch 13 the Social Mobility and Child Poverty Commission` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 8(1) the body is the Commission` `sch 13 the former Child Poverty Commission` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 8(1) the body is the Commission` `sch 13 any other body` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(1) the name that now stands in the definition of the Commission` "Child Poverty Commission" EQUALS JUST "Social Mobility and Child Poverty Commission"
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(1) the name that now stands in the definition of the Commission` "Some Other Name" EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 13 CPA 18(1) Minister of the Crown`

#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(1) the person is a Minister of the Crown` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(1) the person is a Minister of the Crown` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(1) the person is a Minister of the Crown` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `sch 13 CPA 18(3) appointed day for Northern Ireland`

-- order made by a Minister with the Assembly's consent, appointing 1 June 2014 (invented)
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) (JUST (Date 1 6 2014)) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 2 6 2014) (JUST (Date 1 6 2014)) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no consent: the order is not one the definition describes
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) (JUST (Date 1 6 2014)) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not made by a Minister of the Crown
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) (JUST (Date 1 6 2014)) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the fact is not stated
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) (JUST (Date 1 6 2014)) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) (JUST (Date 1 6 2014)) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- no day appointed yet
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- one limb false beats a limb that is not stated
#ASSERT `sch 13 CPA 18(3) the day is the appointed day for Northern Ireland for the provision` (Date 1 6 2014) NOTHING (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
